xYTIwN2YyYWYwN2I5OWYzM2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Pawel Huryn","email":"pawel.huryn@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-07T09:00:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Pawel Huryn","email":"pawel.huryn@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-07T09:00:27Z"},"message":"Rework repo to be domain-agnostic\n\nRemove all content-creation specific files and language. The architecture\nnow works for any agent workflow: engineering, research, ops, or anything else.\n\nKey changes:\n- CLAUDE.md: abstract template with no domain-specific routing\n- knowledge/INDEX.md: lean routing layer, expand as you go\n- knowledge/hypotheses/: examples rewritten with engineering/research/ops scenarios\n- knowledge/system-maintenance.md: domain-neutral language throughout\n- Deleted: craft/, platforms/, posts/, topics/ directories\n- Deleted: examples/content-creator/\n- Added: examples/software-engineer/, examples/researcher/, examples/ops-engineer/\n  — each with a filled-in CLAUDE.md and knowledge/INDEX.md only\n- README.md: rewritten for any Claude Code user, not just content creators\n\nRepo is now 12 files vs 25. The architecture speaks for itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5706b913981c8e944781cad67eb2f2d50c641c84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/agent-second-brain/git/trees/5706b913981c8e944781cad67eb2f2d50c641c84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/agent-second-brain/git/commits/fdf92df1a2dc2404f3503f1a207f2af07b99f33f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/agent-second-brain/commits/fdf92df1a2dc2404f3503f1a207f2af07b99f33f","html_url":"https://github.com/phuryn/agent-second-brain/commit/fdf92df1a2dc2404f3503f1a207f2af07b99f33f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/agent-second-brain/commits/fdf92df1a2dc2404f3503f1a207f2af07b99f33f/comments","author":{"login":"phuryn","id":7837354,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc